
---
import SiteLayout from "../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---

<SiteLayout
    title="Physics — Antemundane sprǣc"
    description="Explore physics through questions, derivations, experiments, and simulations."
>
    <section class="subject-hero">
        <p class="eyebrow">EXPLORE THE UNIVERSE</p>

        <h1>Physics</h1>

        <p class="subject-introduction">
            From the motion of a falling object to the structure of
            the universe, physics is an attempt to understand the
            fundamental principles governing reality.
        </p>

        <p class="subject-secondary">
            Question. Derive. Experiment. Discover.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="subject-explore">
        <div class="section-heading">
            <p class="eyebrow">FIND YOUR DIRECTION</p>
            <h2>Explore Physics</h2>
            <p>
                There is more than one way to approach a physical
                question. Choose a path and start exploring.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="subject-branches">

            <a class="subject-branch" href="/physics/interesting-topics/">
                <span class="branch-number">01</span>
                <h3>Interesting Topics</h3>
                <p>
                    Unusual questions, fascinating phenomena,
                    and ideas worth investigating.
                </p>
                <span class="branch-link">Explore topics →</span>
            </a>

            <a class="subject-branch" href="/physics/experiments/">
                <span class="branch-number">02</span>
                <h3>Experiments & Simulations</h3>
                <p>
                    Turn theoretical ideas into experiments,
                    visualizations, and interactive models.
                </p>
                <span class="branch-link">Start experimenting →</span>
            </a>

            <a class="subject-branch" href="/physics/forum/">
                <span class="branch-number">03</span>
                <h3>Forum</h3>
                <p>
                    Discuss problems, exchange explanations,
                    and challenge different perspectives.
                </p>
                <span class="branch-link">Join the discussion →</span>
            </a>

            <a class="subject-branch" href="/physics/games/">
                <span class="branch-number">04</span>
                <h3>Fun Games</h3>
                <p>
                    Explore physical principles through puzzles,
                    challenges, and playful experiments.
                </p>
                <span class="branch-link">Play and discover →</span>
            </a>

        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="subject-questions">
        <p class="eyebrow">A FEW QUESTIONS TO BEGIN WITH</p>
        <h2>Where curiosity begins</h2>

        <ul>
            <li>Why is the cycloid the curve of fastest descent?</li>
            <li>Can we understand time without understanding space?</li>
            <li>What actually happens when two particles collide?</li>
        </ul>
    </section>
</SiteLayout>
